                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17431256" author="ivandasch" created="Wed, 20 Oct 2021 13:58:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Also, we should skip building &lt;tt&gt;docfx&lt;/tt&gt; docs in &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Build .NET and C++, because we build it twice, second time during assembly binaries step.&lt;br/&gt;
So, windows step should only build odbc msi installers, nothing more.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I have fixed some parts in build scripts, now build on TC2 is passed on my PR&lt;br/&gt;
.NET binaries and nugets should be built in one command&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
pwsh ./build.ps1 -skipJava -skipExamples
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci2.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/Releases_NightlyRelease_RunApacheIgniteNightlyRelease/6181276&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TC2 build&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also, on &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/Releases_NightlyRelease_RunApacheIgniteNightlyRelease/6234718?buildTab=dependencies&amp;amp;mode=list&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TC1&lt;/a&gt; also my patch fixes old build.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ptupitsyn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ptupitsyn&quot;&gt;ptupitsyn&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vveider&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vveider&quot;&gt;vveider&lt;/a&gt; Could you please review my patch?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17432938" author="vveider" created="Fri, 22 Oct 2021 12:02:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt; &#8211; what should be checked?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17432950" author="ivandasch" created="Fri, 22 Oct 2021 12:34:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;rpm specs, release files, etc. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17433044" author="ptupitsyn" created="Fri, 22 Oct 2021 15:37:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
1. Please see one comment on GitHub about nightly version suffix&lt;br/&gt;
2. Let&apos;s remove &quot;Assemble NuGet Packages&quot; configuration&lt;br/&gt;
3. &quot;#2 Assemble Binaries&quot; should produce nupkg artifacts&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17433594" author="vveider" created="Mon, 25 Oct 2021 07:01:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ptupitsyn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ptupitsyn&quot;&gt;ptupitsyn&lt;/a&gt; &#8211; I&apos;ve made changes to release build configuration and currently it passes, but it seems that they are not included in final zip archive. How it should be delivered?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17433686" author="vveider" created="Mon, 25 Oct 2021 10:53:03 +0000"  >&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/check.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt; Nightly: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/Releases_NightlyRelease_RunApacheIgniteNightlyRelease/6238967&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/Releases_NightlyRelease_RunApacheIgniteNightlyRelease/6238967&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/check.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&#160;Release: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/Releases_ApacheIgniteMain_ReleaseBuild/6234984&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/Releases_ApacheIgniteMain_ReleaseBuild/6234984&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="17433713" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 25 Oct 2021 12:03:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The issue with version numbers was caused by the fact that Apache.Ignite.Schema.csproj did not include SharedAssemblyInfo (my mistake from before).&lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;ve prepared a new PR with the fixed csproj and without pom.xml changes: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/9524&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/9524&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Nightly build now passes: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/Releases_NightlyRelease_ApacheIgniteNightlyReleaseAssembleBinaries/6238555&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/Releases_NightlyRelease_ApacheIgniteNightlyReleaseAssembleBinaries/6238555&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17433751" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 25 Oct 2021 13:11:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vveider&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vveider&quot;&gt;vveider&lt;/a&gt; it would be great to put NuGet packages to SVN along with binary, slim binary, and source zip files, so we can verify them (nugets) during the vote and later publish.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let&apos;s handle this separately: &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15816&quot; title=&quot;.NET: Put NuGet packages to SVN for release vote&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-15816&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-15816&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17433756" author="ivandasch" created="Mon, 25 Oct 2021 13:18:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ptupitsyn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ptupitsyn&quot;&gt;ptupitsyn&lt;/a&gt; Could you please add one line to &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
%define __jar_repack %{nil}
%define user ignite
%define _libdir /usr/lib
%define _log %{_var}/log
%define _sharedstatedir /&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/lib
+ %define _binaries_in_noarch_packages_terminate_build 0
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;to &lt;tt&gt;./packaging/rpm/apache-ignite.spec&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Currently, this line is added by sed on TC&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17433757" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 25 Oct 2021 13:19:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt; done.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
